----------------- Physical Case Definition ( Zone 0 ) -------------------
Compressible Laminar Navier-Stokes' equations.
Mach number: 10.18.
Angle of attack (AoA): 0 deg, and angle of sideslip (AoS): 0 deg.
Reynolds number: 0. Reference length 1.
Reading and writing binary SU2 native restart files.
Read flow solution from: restart_stage1.dat.
Dimensional simulation.
The reference area is 0.0242649 m^2.
The semi-span will be computed using the max y(3D) value.
The reference length is 0.17577 m.
Reference origin for moment evaluation is (0, 0, 0).
Surface(s) where the force coefficients are evaluated: wall.

Surface(s) plotted in the output file: wall.
Input mesh file name: mesh.su2

--------------- Space Numerical Integration ( Zone 0 ) ------------------
Simple Low-Dissipation AUSM 2 solver for the flow inviscid terms.
Standard Roe without low-dissipation function.
First order integration in space.
Average of gradients with correction (viscous flow terms).
Gradient for upwind reconstruction: unweighted Least-Squares.
Gradient for viscous and source terms: Green-Gauss.

--------------- Time Numerical Integration  ( Zone 0 ) ------------------
Local time stepping (steady state simulation).
Euler implicit method for the flow equations.
FGMRES is used for solving the linear system.
Using a ILU(0) preconditioning.
Convergence criteria of the linear solver: 0.0001.
Max number of linear iterations: 30.
No CFL adaptation.
Courant-Friedrichs-Lewy number:      0.5

------------------ Convergence Criteria  ( Zone 0 ) ---------------------
Maximum number of solver subiterations: 4000.
Begin convergence monitoring at iteration 500.
Residual minimum value: 1e-10.
Cauchy series min. value: 2e-05.
Number of Cauchy elements: 500.
Begin windowed time average at iteration 0.

